WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:06.060
Chapter 24

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:06.060
Determination

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.050
I can't lose...

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:16.780
this battle!

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:18.810
I have to do this!

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:35.530
Thank you for escorting me.

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:40.740
I was able to return home safely thanks to everyone from Squad 7.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.500
Please...

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.960
rest a bit while you can.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.370
All right?

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:48.460
If you'll excuse me...

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.920
Welkin.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.470
Alicia wishes for this{to have a good rest?} as well.

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:57.720
Please try to understand her feelings.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:13.280
You guys satisfied?

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:17.240
I'm asking if you guys are satisfied.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.970
Come on, Rosie.

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:21.580
I know.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.290
We were the ones that drove Alicia away.

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:25.330
But...

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:29.120
is it okay if we just sit here while being saved by that very person?!

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:32.210
She's still fighting even now.

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:33.800
Fighting all alone...

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.150
This is bad.

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:54.610
She's being pushed back by the opposing Valkyria.

00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:00.820
What's she doing being held back?! Ghirlandaio is right there!

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.280
What should we do?

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:08.370
Even though we used a monster to fight another monster...

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.630
General!

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.210
General!

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:17.760
The 3rd and 5th tank units have arrived!

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.340
What the hell are you doing?

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.680
Get the whole army to retreat to a safe place immediately!

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.180
Safe?

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:27.930
Which area is safe?

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:31.150
How the hell would I know?!

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:40.740
What am I fighting for?

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:43.240
I no longer have...

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:47.750
a home or any companions left...

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.870
I have...

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.170
nothing left.

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:55.210
Is this all of your power?

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:00.420
Why can this person...

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:10.520
Why can she fight like this?

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.980
For what sake?

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.610
This person...

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:31.370
I...

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.120
I know...

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:36.340
...this person from long ago!

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:53.560
What should I have done?

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:08.280
The Alicia Melchiott you knew is gone for good.

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:31.100
Farewell, Welkin.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:40.730
But...

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.440
Even so, I...

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.760
I remember!

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.610
She was...

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:43.750
How can you fight like this?

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:44.670
What?

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:47.970
You should be alone too.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.390
You were there at the facility too.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.970
You're an orphan too!

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:57.060
I see.

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:58.890
I see how it is.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.940
Alicia, right?

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:07.030
No wonder I find you so familiar.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:10.780
I never thought you'd be from that facility as well.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.830
For old times' sake, let me tell you.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:18.290
Don't bring unnecessary feelings into battle!

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:29.930
It's the end for you!

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.390
What did you say?

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:38.350
This isn't one of the enemy's tricks?

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:38.980
If this is true,

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:42.940
then why now of all times?

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.900
Is this true?

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:47.900
There's no doubt about it.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:50.150
The highest Imperial commander in charge of the Gallian campaign,

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:52.740
Maximilian Gaius von Reginrave,

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:56.080
has showed up personally to call for a truce!

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:03.710
I was alone...

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:04.750
Always...

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:12.800
The reaction to the Ragnite from her brain waves have exceeded expectations.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:16.680
Level 28. Outstanding material.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:17.640
Then...

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.980
Yes, it's decided.

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:21.850
We'll use this girl.

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.770
What about the other candidates?

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.900
Dispose of them appropriately.

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:27.820
To the outside world,

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:33.070
this is just a charitable facility for orphaned children.

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:36.910
I'm counting on you guys for the transport of A1.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.330
Be quick.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:42.290
Cut it out!

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.210
How many times do you have to escape before you realize it?

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:48.840
You have no other place to go besides here.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:52.340
Stand up, A1.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:56.970
Say, A1.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:00.640
As long as you're a descendant of the Valkyrur, the experiments will continue.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.810
For the good of us both,

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.770
you'd better learn your place.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:11.110
Fine!

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:12.280
Do what you want!

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.610
But your future won't change.

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:15.950
It definitely won't!

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:25.460
I hated the world.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.000
However...

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:35.880
Stop, A1!

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:36.930
Stop!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.100
I told you to stop!

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:57.700
A single meeting changed my entire future.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:00.160
What is your name?

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:02.870
A1.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.170
Selvaria.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:10.040
The name of this flower.

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:13.170
That'll be your name from now on.

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:16.470
Work for me.

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:17.970
Come with me,

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:19.260
Selvaria.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.980
My reason for fighting...

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:37.820
Your Highness!

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:41.870
Leave the enemy forces to Selvaria,

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:45.040
and the Commander will go and have an intimate talk with Gallia's princess.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.330
Although we used a distraction,

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:50.790
I never thought we'd get so close to Randgriz so easily.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.550
It means the enemy has their hands full too.

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:58.260
Well, even if they resist, the result won't change.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:02.220
Will the colonel be all right?

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:07.520
Nothing will happen even if you worry, right?

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:16.570
I have no intention of going back on my words.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:20.700
Even then, what exactly do you mean by a "ceasefire?"

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.910
Exactly what it means.

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:27.040
The citizens are suffering, and Gallia may very well be ruined.

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:30.710
I came to present a way to end this war of attrition.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:33.880
We are slowly gaining the advantage in this war.

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:37.210
We will be victorious if the war continues as it has.

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:41.050
Pray tell, for what reason are we discussing this then?

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:45.390
The same to you. Why now of all times?

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:45.850
Borg.

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:53.020
There is no doubt that the citizens are suffering because of this war.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:55.650
That is not what I desire.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:57.820
Please state your conditions.

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:02.070
Open up Randgriz without putting up resistance.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.740
And...

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:05.120
Cordelia,

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.280
become my wife.

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:09.200
Ridiculous!

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:13.920
This war won't simply be forgotten just because of a political marriage!

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.460
I am fully aware.

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:18.130
So trivial.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:23.430
Your objective is to obtain Gallia's throne!

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:25.220
Is that right?

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:29.390
You started the war for the sake of that?

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:30.270
"That"?

00:11:31.430 --> 00:11:33.060
"That," you say?

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.730
How foolish!

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:36.480
As long as I have the throne,

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:40.740
and obtain the blood of the Valkyrur running in the Randgriz family...

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.450
Everything will be mine!

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:47.490
No longer will I be entangled in the pointless struggles for power within the Empire!

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:51.370
I will be able to build the world I envision!

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.420
That's impossible.

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:57.500
I am not a descendant of the Valkyrur.

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:02.880
P-Princess!

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:05.550
I am a Darcsen!

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:18.480
Alicia...

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:20.110
I've been thinking this whole time.

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:23.070
About what you want,

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:26.490
and how I can help you.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.780
But...

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:28.990
From now on...

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:38.380
You guys...

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:42.630
Seriously. You're carrying so much stuff with you.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:44.550
It's obvious what you're going to do with just a glance.

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:46.760
Rosie.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:49.470
Don't try to sneak away.

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:50.260
Largo.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.520
You're going, right?

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.390
Then we're going too!

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:59.310
No. If you guys do this, you'll get court-martialed.

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:00.420
Commander.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.530
We've already decided.

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:03.490
Right?

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:04.240
Yeah.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:07.070
I have to apologize to Alicia!

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:09.620
Exactly! We can't go on like this!

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:12.290
Everyone's realized it.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:16.330
It doesn't matter if Alicia is a Valkyria or not.

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:19.210
She's our friend.

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:29.590
I concede.

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:31.930
Great!

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:35.480
Alicia.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:37.850
I'm going to do what I want to do.

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:40.110
I...

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:41.860
...want to meet you!

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:48.990
It's no use...

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.780
I can't win.

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:54.200
That person has something I don't have.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:55.450
Strength...

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:57.000
No.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:01.040
She probably has something precious to her.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.750
She has the resolve to protect it.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:04.920
I too...

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:17.020
have my reasons for fighting...

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.480
It's over!

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:26.440
I have...

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:27.610
it too.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:29.950
I also...

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:32.370
have reasons why...

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:33.660
I can't lose!

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.670
This is...

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:52.260
She still had this power left in her.

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:53.390
Fine.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.470
We'll decide the victor with the next blow!

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:38.060
What's wrong?

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.600
Finish me.

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:43.060
I can't do such a thing.

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:46.150
You have someone precious to you too, right?

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:48.980
That's why you fought so fiercely.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:55.030
There are many things precious to me too. You made me realize that.

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:56.410
So...

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:58.950
You're so naive.

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:02.910
I can't believe I lost to you.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:06.290
"There's hope as long as you live."

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:08.630
That's what Welkin said.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:09.800
So...

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.420
Looks like you don't get it.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:14.720
The moment I lost to you,

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:17.550
I lost my value.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.310
That's not true!

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:21.640
You're still alive.

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.100
You'll definitely...

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:25.190
You're a strange girl.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.650
Now that you've awoken as a Valkyria,

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:30.320
you can still say such idealistic things.

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:32.360
I didn't mean to...

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:34.570
Looks like the talking ends here.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:38.740
Well done!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:40.540
Capture her!

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:43.960
If...

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:47.130
No, it's nothing.

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:50.710
I must follow my convictions.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.090
Even if I have to bet my life on it.

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:56.300
Selvaria...

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:57.720
What are you trying to do?!

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:02.560
Maximilian.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:05.310
More than anything,

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:06.600
I...

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.100
You're wrong!

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:10.270
You won't achieve anything through death! {Literal: Loyalty by death, or something}

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:11.570
I will.

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:15.740
Goodbye.

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:56.440
You're... a Darcsen?!

00:17:56.440 --> 00:18:00.660
If I tell the citizens that I am a Darcsen,

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:03.700
the Randgriz name will be defaced,

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:06.910
and you will not be able to take advantage of me.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:12.920
Seems like it is time to end this fake history.

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:21.510
If so, I have no need of you anymore!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:22.350
Yes sir!

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:24.890
By orders of His Highness,

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.810
we're to begin the operation!

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:31.020
Okay! Let's get the show on the road!

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.200
What's that?

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:06.390
What?!

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:10.310
Your Highness!

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.440
We're going.

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:16.070
We have one more objective to fulfill.

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:24.450
Your Highness.

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:25.580
What is it?

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:30.750
Communications between Ghirlandaio and Colonel Selvaria have been severed.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:31.960
I see.

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:33.630
"I see"?

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:35.340
"I see," you say?

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.380
It's a pity.

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:41.050
Selvaria still had her uses.

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:47.470
How could you say that?!

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:48.890
The colonel...

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:51.680
She fought for your sake!

00:19:56.770 --> 00:20:00.610
Those who block my path will all end up like this.

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:01.740
Remember that.

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:14.700
No one can live on their own.

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:17.290
But if people only hurt each other,

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:20.960
what's the point in living?

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.830
Having frightening powers,

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:26.780
and fighting in the name of Gallia...

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.580
I am a Valkyria.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:31.890
Next time on Valkyria Chronicles,

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:34.840
Chapter 25: What Must be Protected.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:40.930
Did I manage to protect everyone?

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:41.000
Chapter 25

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:41.000
What Must be Protected
